      "category": "src_content",
      "merged_text": "God bless you Dear Mrs. Geraci. Yes, Mrs. Geraci, Your letter to Brooklyn was forwarde to me shortly. Noted the holy Masses as requeste and do trust that everything comes according to God's holy designs. How wonderful are His ways -- and His mercy is above all His works. Blessed be His divine Providence!",
